### REST API Tests - Gestion Options Etudiants
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest
### Exécuter chaque requête et prendre un screenshot du résultat

### ============================================================
### 1. OPTIONS - CRUD
### ============================================================

### 1.1 POST /options - Ajouter une option
### Screenshot: option_post.png
POST http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/options
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeOption": 6,
  "libelle": "Biologie",
  "domaine": "Sciences",
  "responsable": "M. Responsable Biologie",
  "credits": 18,
  "semestre": 1,
  "capacite": 20
}

### 1.2 GET /options - Lister toutes les options
### Screenshot: option_get_all.png
GET http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/options
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 GET /options?domaine=Mathématiques - Filtrer par domaine
### Screenshot: option_get_by_domaine.png
GET http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/options?domaine=Math%C3%A9matiques
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 GET /options/{code} - Obtenir une option par code
### Screenshot: option_get_by_code.png
GET http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/options/1
Accept: application/json

### 1.5 PUT /options/{code} - Modifier une option
### Screenshot: option_put.png
PUT http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/options/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeOption": 1,
  "libelle": "Informatique Avancée",
  "domaine": "Informatique",
  "responsable": "M. Nouveau Responsable",
  "credits": 35,
  "semestre": 2,
  "capacite": 40
}

### 1.6 DELETE /options/{code} - Supprimer une option
### Screenshot: option_delete.png
DELETE http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/options/5

### ============================================================
### 2. ETUDIANTS - CRUD
### ============================================================

### 2.1 POST /etudiants - Ajouter un étudiant (option codeOption=2 doit exister)
### Screenshot: etudiant_post.png
POST http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/etudiants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifiant": "I004",
  "nom": "Martin",
  "prenom": "Sophie",
  "option": {
    "codeOption": 2
  },
  "anneeEtude": 2024,
  "email": "sophie.martin@example.com"
}

### 2.2 GET /etudiants - Lister tous les étudiants
### Screenshot: etudiant_get_all.png
GET http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/etudiants
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 GET /etudiants/{identifiant} - Obtenir un étudiant par identifiant
### Screenshot: etudiant_get_by_id.png
GET http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/etudiants/I001
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 PUT /etudiants/{identifiant} - Modifier un étudiant
### Screenshot: etudiant_put.png
PUT http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/etudiants/I001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifiant": "I001",
  "nom": "Doe",
  "prenom": "Jean-Pierre",
  "option": {
    "codeOption": 1
  },
  "anneeEtude": 2024,
  "email": "jean-pierre.doe@example.com"
}

### 2.5 DELETE /etudiants/{identifiant} - Supprimer un étudiant
### Screenshot: etudiant_delete.png
DELETE http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/etudiants/I003

### 2.6 GET /etudiants/option?codeOption=1 - Étudiants par option (XML)
### Screenshot: etudiant_get_by_option_xml.png
GET http://localhost:8080/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/etudiants/option?codeOption=1
Accept: application/xml
